# SDD: Parity Model
status: draft
authority: migration-parity

## Goal
Provide complete, auditable coverage from source capability to CRONUS-native implementation.

## Required statuses
NOT_STARTED
INVENTORIED
SPECIFIED
KERNEL_GAP
IMPLEMENTING
FUNCTIONAL_PARITY
VISUAL_PARITY
VERIFIED
BLOCKED
INTENTIONAL_DIFFERENCE

## Rule
Only VERIFIED counts as migrated.

## Scope categories
tokens
theme
component-foundation
component-forms
component-overlays-navigation
component-data-display
component-premium
registry
cli
compose
scaffold
stack-builder
ai-kit
mcp
docs
examples
e2e
release-tooling

## Evidence
Each VERIFIED row must reference tests and, where UI-visible, representative runtime/visual evidence.
